abstract: >-
  MATLAB code for "Practical Complete Tracking Through
  Gimbaled Unidirectional Actuation with Application to
  Multirotor UAVs," which presents a tracking controller for
  vehicles with gimbaled unidirectional actuators that stays
  well defined through free fall. Includes the controller,
  reference trajectory, and scripts that reproduce every
  figure.
